    <main class="about-page">

        <h1>About</h1>

        <div class="about-text">

            <p>
                Objects With Stories is a digital archive for the things
                people find difficult to leave behind.
            </p>

            <p>
                A childhood toy, an old piece of clothing, a letter,
                a photograph, a book, a piece of furniture, or something
                that might appear insignificant to somebody else can carry
                years of memory.
            </p>

            <p>
                This archive invites people to photograph an object,
                describe its history, and preserve its story digitally.
            </p>

            <p>
                Visitors can browse the archive and encounter strangers
                through the objects they choose to keep.
            </p>

        </div>

    </main>

